CLIPVERSE — AI-Powered Short-Form Content Automation Platform

CLIPVERSE is an intelligent, all-in-one AI-powered content clipping and social media automation platform designed to turn long-form videos into engaging, viral-ready short-form content.

With CLIPVERSE, users can automatically discover the most engaging moments in videos, generate high-quality clips, add dynamic captions, optimize content for vertical formats, and publish across multiple social media platforms — all from one dashboard.

Key Features

- AI Video Clipping: Automatically identifies interesting, engaging and potentially viral moments.
- Smart Editing: Creates polished short videos with automatic reframing, subtitles and captions.
- Multi-Platform Publishing: Distributes content across YouTube Shorts, Instagram Reels, TikTok, Facebook Reels and other supported platforms.
- 24/7 Automation: Automates the clipping, editing and publishing workflow with minimal manual involvement.
- Performance Analytics: Tracks views, engagement and content performance to identify successful clips.
- Smart Notifications: Notifies users when videos are published and when content achieves significant performance milestones.
- Multiple Channels: Manage multiple social media accounts and content channels from one place.
- Centralized Dashboard: Monitor automation jobs, published clips, channel activity and analytics in a unified interface.

Our Vision

Make professional short-form content creation and distribution accessible to everyone through intelligent automation.

